# FULL TRACE: every registered QEMU trace event.
#
# Use `*` to match all events. The simple backend writes them to a
# 1024-entry ring buffer which a worker thread flushes ~every 100 ms.
# If event rate exceeds drain rate, some events will be dropped
# (a "Lost N events" line appears in the converted text trace).
#
# This is high-overhead. If GPU init starts failing again, switch to
# the curated set with:
#   cp trace-events-safe.list trace-events.list
*
